// registry/deferral half (MCP registration, Tool Search); this file owns ChildHandle, the
// adapter/router seam, and the two control-subtype bridges (McpControlSeam, sdk_mcp_call).
//
// Lanes A-D: THIS FILE IS THE SEAM AUTHORITY -- keep it green; do not edit it. If your change makes
// one of these tests fail, your change is inconsistent with the seam contract this task pinned, not
// a reason to relax the assertion. (If the contract itself is genuinely wrong, that is a spine
