// (ii) proves the adapter/router seam semantics (MessagingRouterSeam) against the spine's own fake.
// (iii) is tools/seam-contracts-p4.test.ts's own charter (isLoadFirstBlocked, extended there).
// (iv) proves McpControlSeam + rpc/mcp-control.ts's own handlers round-trip for all four
// host->runtime MCP control subtypes (mcp_status reads McpServerStateSource directly -- it has no
// McpControlSeam method of its own, see mcp/control-seam.ts's own header for why).
// (v) proves the sdk_mcp_call CONTRACT both legs of the bridge agree on: the WinterMcpServerInstance
// shape (packages/sdk/src/options.ts) a host's `instance` must satisfy to be end-to-end callable --
// the host-side responder's own full behavioral suite (registration gating, error taxonomy, the
